<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila to sell additional stake in National Steel.</title>
<headline>Manila to sell additional stake in National Steel.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines' Committee on Privatisation (CoP) said it had approved a plan to sell another 12.5 percent in the National Steel Corp to Wing Tiek Holdings Bhd.</p>
<p>The official told reporters the sale came after two failed biddings for the 25 percent of the government's stake in the integrated steel mill.</p>
<p>Wing Tiek Holdings holds 75 percent stake in National Steel.</p>
<p>The 12.5 percent equity represents around 280 million shares with an estimated value of 2.8 billion pesos.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
